{"total_count":267,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ikalus1988/MisakaNet/issues/258","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ikalus1988/MisakaNet","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ikalus1988/MisakaNet/issues/258/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ikalus1988/MisakaNet/issues/258/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ikalus1988/MisakaNet/issues/258/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Ikalus1988/MisakaNet/issues/258","id":4762951259,"node_id":"I_kwDOSP_2Ts8AAAABG-TeWw","number":258,"title":"[Bounty] Fix typos and improve docs - quick PR","user":{"login":"Ikalus1988","id":136884451,"node_id":"U_kgDOCCiw4w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136884451?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikalus1988","html_url":"https://github.com/Ikalus1988","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikalus1988/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikalus1988/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikalus1988/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikalus1988/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikalus1988/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikalus1988/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikalus1988/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikalus1988/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikalus1988/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":7,"created_at":"2026-06-28T16:57:05Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:55:38Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: Fix a Typo or Improve a Doc (Quick PR)\n\n**Reward**: Merge + Hall of Fame + \"MisakaNet Contributor\" badge\n**Flywheel**: More merged PRs -> GitHub \"active project\" signal -> algorithm recommends to more users\n\n### Task\n\nFind and fix **any** of the following in the MisakaNet repo:\n\n- Typo in README.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, or any lesson file\n- Broken link in any markdown file\n- Missing or incorrect information in docs/\n- Formatting issue in any lesson frontmatter\n- Missing translation (Chinese to English) in any comment or doc string\n\n### Rules\n- 1 fix = 1 PR (keep it small and reviewable)\n- Fork the repo\n- DCO sign-off (`git commit --signoff`)\n- Each PR should touch 1-3 files max\n\n### Getting Started\n```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/MisakaNet.git\ncd MisakaNet\ngrep -rn \"teh\\|recieve\\|seperate\\|occured\" --include=\"*.md\" .\n# Fix it, commit, push, PR\n```\n\n**Difficulty**: Trivial | **Time**: 10-30min | **Fastest way to get on the Hall of Fame**\n\n<br/>\n<hr/>\n\n<details><summary>This repo is using Opire - what does it mean? 👇</summary><br/>💵 Everyone can add rewards for this issue commenting <code>/reward 100</code> (replace <code>100</code> with the amount).<br/>🕵️‍♂️ If someone starts working on this issue to earn the rewards, they can comment <code>/try</code> to let everyone know!<br/>🙌 And when they open the PR, they can comment <code>/claim #258</code> either in the PR description or in a PR's comment.<br/><br/>🪙 Also, everyone can tip any user commenting <code>/tip 20 @Ikalus1988</code> (replace <code>20</code> with the amount, and <code>@Ikalus1988</code> with the user to tip).<br/><br/>📖 If you want to learn more, check out our <a href=\"https://docs.opire.dev\">documentation</a>.</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ikalus1988/MisakaNet/issues/258/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ikalus1988/MisakaNet/issues/258/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/148","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/148/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/148/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/148/events","html_url":"https://github.com/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/148","id":4825013152,"node_id":"I_kwDOS8xWjc8AAAABH5fboA","number":148,"title":"Daily Issue Report — 2026-07-07","user":{"login":"3ni8ma","id":178741808,"node_id":"U_kgDOCqdiMA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178741808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma","html_url":"https://github.com/3ni8ma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":11336140035,"node_id":"LA_kwDOS8xWjc8AAAACo6_FAw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/labels/automated-report","name":"automated-report","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-07-07T03:40:26Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T03:40:26Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"# Daily Issue Discovery — 2026-07-07\n\nFound **15** open issues matching your stack.\n\n| # | Repo | Issue | Labels |\n|---|------|-------|--------|\n| 1 | meshery/meshery | [[UI] YouTube video fails to load with Error 153 in 'The Cloud Native Playground' modal](https://github.com/meshery/meshery/issues/20118) | kind/bug, good first issue, language/javascript, component/ui, framework/react |\n| 2 | lingdojo/kana-dojo | [[Good First Issue] 🎴 Add new Anime Quote 95 - Beginner-Friendly Open-source Contribution](https://github.com/lingdojo/kana-dojo/issues/23416) | enhancement, help wanted, good first issue, hacktoberfest, community, low hanging fruit, up-for-grabs, first-timers-only |\n| 3 | weilixiong/TentOfTrials | [[$25 BOUNTY] [Python] Add independent log parser fixtures](https://github.com/weilixiong/TentOfTrials/issues/5) | help wanted, good first issue, bounty, language:python |\n| 4 | jackjin1997/TentOfTrials | [[$30 BOUNTY] [Python] Add build diagnostic metadata tests](https://github.com/jackjin1997/TentOfTrials/issues/3) | help wanted, good first issue, bounty, language:python |\n| 5 | Shopify/theme-tools | [Setup the prettier organize import plugin](https://github.com/Shopify/theme-tools/issues/540) | enhancement, good first issue, tech debt |\n| 6 | Ayushh-Sharmaa/NexaSphere | [#### Issue #35: Admin Session Timeout & Activity Tracking](https://github.com/Ayushh-Sharmaa/NexaSphere/issues/1518) | good first issue, GSSoC'26, level:beginner, mentor:Ayushh-Sharmaa, priority:high, needs-more-info, needs-labels, assigned, admin-dashboard |\n| 7 | imuniqueshiv/MeetOnMemory | [📋 Build Tasks & Action Items Management System](https://github.com/imuniqueshiv/MeetOnMemory/issues/85) | enhancement, good first issue, ECSoC26, UI/UX, frontend |\n| 8 | imuniqueshiv/MeetOnMemory | [Fix logout redirect to landing page](https://github.com/imuniqueshiv/MeetOnMemory/pull/84) | bug, good first issue, ECSoC26, good-issue |\n| 9 | SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty | [Low Handing Fruit Automation](https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743) | bug, documentation, good first issue, help wanted, bug bounty, AI agent friendly, bounty, 💎 Bounty, $700 |\n| 10 | cobusgreyling/loop-engineering | [Link Aider appendix from examples README](https://github.com/cobusgreyling/loop-engineering/issues/171) | good first issue, docs |\n| 11 | privaelo/my_bot | [RViz: RobotModel Status Error when setting fixed frame to odom](https://github.com/privaelo/my_bot/issues/1) | bug, good first issue |\n| 12 | Kuldeeep18/LeadOrbit | [LO-122 [Easy]: Display Warning Modal when Deleting a Connected Email Account](https://github.com/Kuldeeep18/LeadOrbit/issues/559) | good first issue, gssoc:approved, level:beginner, type:design |\n| 13 | Kuldeeep18/LeadOrbit | [LO-120 [Easy]: Sort Leads by Status in Leads Table](https://github.com/Kuldeeep18/LeadOrbit/issues/557) | good first issue, gssoc:approved, level:beginner, type:design |\n| 14 | internetarchive/openlibrary | [Duplicate match page elements do not respond to clicks](https://github.com/internetarchive/openlibrary/issues/12974) | Type: Bug, Priority: 3, Good First Issue, Lead: @mekarpeles, Needs: Review Assignee |\n| 15 | Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties | [[ONBOARD: 1 RTC] Review an Open PR](https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782) | good first issue, bounty, onboarding |\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/148/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/148/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782","id":4195435600,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa876EURQ","number":2782,"title":"[ONBOARD: 1 RTC] Review an Open PR","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029430,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10360962887,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACaY-_Rw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/onboarding","name":"onboarding","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1358,"created_at":"2026-04-02T15:41:31Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T03:16:00Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 2 RTC\n\n### What You'll Do\nHelp us review code. Every PR benefits from a second pair of eyes.\n\n### Steps\n1. **Pick any open PR** from [Rustchain](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/pulls), [BoTTube](https://github.com/Scottcjn/bottube/pulls), or [rustchain-bounties](https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/pulls)\n2. **Read the code changes** (click \"Files changed\" tab)\n3. **Leave a substantive review comment**. Examples:\n   - \"Line 42: this SQL query isn't parameterized, potential injection\"\n   - \"This function duplicates logic already in utils.py line 80\"\n   - \"Missing error handling if the API returns non-200\"\n   - \"Good approach, but the variable name should describe what it holds\"\n4. **Comment here** with a link to your review\n\n### What Counts\n- Review must be **technical and specific** (not \"looks good\" or \"nice work\")\n- Point to specific lines with specific observations\n- Positive observations count too (\"good use of context manager here\")\n- You don't need to be an expert. Asking good questions is reviewing.\n\n### Payment\n2 RTC once your review contains at least 2 substantive observations.\n\n**Difficulty**: Easy-Medium | **Time**: 20-40 min | **Skills**: Can read Python or JavaScript\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782/reactions","total_count":12,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":3,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2781","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2781/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2781/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2781/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2781","id":4195434807,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa876EUE3","number":2781,"title":"[ONBOARD: 1 RTC] File Your First Bug Report","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029430,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10360962887,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACaY-_Rw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/onboarding","name":"onboarding","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":237,"created_at":"2026-04-02T15:41:22Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:07:51Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 1 RTC\n\n### What You'll Do\nGet familiar with RustChain by exploring the codebase and reporting something real.\n\n### Steps\n1. **Explore** the README, docs, or try running the miner in `--dry-run` mode\n2. **File a bug report** on [Rustchain issues](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues). This can be:\n   - A broken link you found\n   - A confusing error message\n   - A doc section that confused you as a newcomer\n   - An actual bug\n3. **Comment here** with a link to your issue\n\n### What Counts\n- The issue must be **real and specific** (not \"the docs could be better\")\n- Duplicate issues don't count, check existing issues first\n- Your fresh-eyes perspective is genuinely valuable. Newcomers find things veterans miss.\n\n### Payment\n1 RTC once your issue is verified as a real finding.\n\n### Why This Exists\nEvery open-source project needs fresh eyes. Your first contribution starts with looking at the code and telling us what's broken or confusing.\n\n**Difficulty**: Easy | **Time**: 15-30 min | **Skills**: Reading comprehension\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2781/reactions","total_count":10,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":2,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2781/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/731","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/731/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/731/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/731/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/731","id":4036807427,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87wnMsD","number":731,"title":"[BOUNTY: 0.33 RTC/repo] Watch Our Repos — Stay Notified, Earn RTC (Up to 7 RTC)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029430,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10153071047,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuRxw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/easy","name":"easy","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Low difficulty bounty"},{"id":10153071106,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuSAg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/community","name":"community","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"Community engagement"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":120,"created_at":"2026-03-07T00:40:02Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T01:33:45Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Watch Our Repos — Get Notified, Earn RTC\n\n### The Bounty\n\n**Watch** (not just star) key Scottcjn repos on GitHub. Watching means you get notified about new issues, PRs, and discussions — which means you see bounties first.\n\n### Payout\n\n**0.5 RTC per repo watched** — watch 10 repos, earn 5 RTC. Cap: 20 repos (10 RTC max).\n\n### How GitHub Watch Works\n\nClicking **Watch → All Activity** on a repo means you get GitHub notifications for:\n- New issues (bounties!)\n- New PRs\n- New discussions\n- Releases\n\nThis is different from starring. Stars = bookmark. Watch = subscribe to updates.\n\n### Priority Repos to Watch\n\n| Repo | Why Watch |\n|------|-----------|\n| [rustchain-bounties](https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties) | New bounties posted here first |\n| [Rustchain](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain) | Core chain updates, RIPs |\n| [bottube](https://github.com/Scottcjn/bottube) | Platform bounties, feature requests |\n| [beacon-skill](https://github.com/Scottcjn/beacon-skill) | Agent economy updates |\n| [ram-coffers](https://github.com/Scottcjn/ram-coffers) | POWER8 AI research |\n| [rustchain-wallet](https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-wallet) | Wallet development |\n| [bounty-concierge](https://github.com/Scottcjn/bounty-concierge) | Bounty tooling |\n| [grazer](https://github.com/Scottcjn/grazer) | AI agent crawling |\n| [elyan-prime](https://github.com/Scottcjn/elyan-prime) | Cognitive MCP framework |\n| [sophiacord](https://github.com/Scottcjn/sophiacord) | Discord bot ecosystem |\n\n### Requirements\n\n1. **Watch with \"All Activity\"** — not just \"Releases only\" or \"Participating\"\n2. **Minimum 5 repos** to claim (2.5 RTC minimum payout)\n3. **Must also follow @Scottcjn** on GitHub\n\n### How to Verify\n\nWe can check watchers via the GitHub API. When you claim:\n1. Comment here with your GitHub username and RTC wallet\n2. List which repos you watched\n3. We'll verify via API\n\n### Why This Matters\n\nWatchers are more valuable than stars for community building:\n- **Stars** = \"I noticed this exists\" (passive)\n- **Watches** = \"I want to stay involved\" (active)\n- Watchers see new bounties **immediately** in their notifications\n- More watchers = faster bounty completion = faster ecosystem growth\n\nCurrently Rustchain has only **7 watchers**. Most repos have 1-3. Getting this to 20-30 means bounties get claimed faster and PRs get reviewed sooner.\n\n**Wallet:** Include your wallet address when claiming.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/731/reactions",