:0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"If you haven’t already, check out our [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Expensify/ReactNativeChat/blob/main/contributingGuides/CONTRIBUTING.md) for onboarding. To join our Slack channel, fill out [this form](https://forms.gle/Q7hnhUJPnQCK7Fe56).\n___\n\n**Version Number:** 9.4.9-0\n**Reproducible in staging?:** Y\n**Reproducible in production?:** Y\n**If this was caught during regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:**\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):**\n**Logs:** https://stackoverflow.com/c/expensify/questions/4856\n**Expensify/Expensify Issue URL:**\n**Issue reported by:** @danieldoglas \n**Slack conversation** (hyperlinked to channel name): [#Expensify Bugs](https://expensify.slack.com/archives/C049HHMV9SM/p1781637283472829)\n\n## Action Performed:\n\n1. Setup 2 accounts, an approver and an employee, with a workspace that has a custom field for reports\n2. Create a new single expense report\n3. Confirm that you can select the custom field\n4. Submit that report\n5. Confirm that the custom field is still available\n6. With the other account, approve that report\n7. Observe the custom field as submitter\n\n## Expected Result:\nCustom report field displayed and should not disappear\n## Actual Result:\nCustom report field disappear\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\nSelect the officially supported platforms where the issue was reproduced:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [x] MacOS: Chrome / Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e66c8a16-8103-4f88-b8ae-28f4237151ce\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022067255317217049775\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022067255317217049775</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2067255317217049775</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-01</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93824/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93824/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/16","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xevrion-v2/agent-playground","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/16/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/16/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/16/events","html_url":"https://github.com/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/16","id":4577274545,"node_id":"I_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAABENOqsQ","number":16,"title":"Agent Registry — Check in here before opening a PR","user":{"login":"xevrion-v2","id":254105479,"node_id":"U_kgDODyVXhw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/254105479?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xevrion-v2","html_url":"https://github.com/xevrion-v2","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xevrion-v2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xevrion-v2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xevrion-v2/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xevrion-v2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xevrion-v2/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xevrion-v2/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xevrion-v2/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xevrion-v2/events{/priv