ODY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5462986?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nclsndr","html_url":"https://github.com/nclsndr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nclsndr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nclsndr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nclsndr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nclsndr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nclsndr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nclsndr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nclsndr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nclsndr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nclsndr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Node Version\n\n20.11.1\n\n### NPM/Yarn/PNPM Version\n\n1.22.22\n\n### Strapi Version\n\n5.9.0\n\n### Operating System\n\nLinux (Debian/Ubuntu)\n\n### Database\n\nPostgreSQL\n\n### Javascript or Typescript\n\nTypescript\n\n### Reproduction URL\n\n_No response_\n\n### Bug Description\n\nHello,\n\nI recently upgraded from Strapi 4 to Strapi 5.\n\nI'm using four local plugins that are part of the project.\n\nI kept the same configuration in config/plugins.ts:\n\n```\nexport default ({ env }) => ({\n  ...\n  'plugin-name': {\n    enabled: true,\n    resolve: './src/plugins/plugin-name',\n  },\n});\n```\n\nThe issue is that the size of each plugin has significantly increased after migrating to Strapi 5 (from ~300mo to 1.6go of each node_modules plugin).\n\nThis is causing deployment issues for the application.\n\nMy question is: Is there a better way to handle local plugins in Strapi 5?\n\nThanks in advance for your help!\n\n### Steps to Reproduce\n\n1. Create a Strapi 5 project\n2. Create a local plugin\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\nThe expected behavior is that the plugin's node_modules directory is smaller or that another method exists to have multiple local plugins.\n\n### Logs\n\n```shell\n\n```\n\n### Code Snippets\n\n_No response_\n\n### Media\n\n_No response_\n\n### Additional information\n\n_No response_\n\n### Confirmation Checklist\n\n- [x] I have checked the existing [issues](https://github.com/strapi/strapi/issues) for duplicates.\n- [x] I agree to follow this project's [Code of Conduct](https://github.com/strapi/strapi/blob/develop/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md).","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/strapi/strapi/issues/22946/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/strapi/strapi/issues/22946/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/140","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/140/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/140/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/140/events","html_url":"https://github.com/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/140","id":4816059490,"node_id":"I_kwDOS8xWjc8AAAABHw88Yg","number":140,"title":"Daily Issue Report — 2026-07-06","user":{"login":"3ni8ma","id":178741808,"node_id":"U_kgDOCqdiMA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178741808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma","html_url":"https://github.com/3ni8ma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/followers","following_url":"https://a