eginner, type:feature, stale |\n| 15 | aliyevaladddin/AladdinAI | [Security: Fix known_hosts: None in SSH connections](https://github.com/aliyevaladddin/AladdinAI/issues/356) | good first issue, security |\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/140/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/140/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/21636","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/21636/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/21636/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/21636/events","html_url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/21636","id":3040175460,"node_id":"I_kwDOI9Wqc861NWVk","number":21636,"title":"tt-metal builds on rocky linux 9","user":{"login":"ThisIsFineTM","id":184989147,"node_id":"U_kgDOCwa12w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184989147?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThisIsFineTM","html_url":"https://github.com/ThisIsFineTM","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThisIsFineTM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThisIsFineTM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThisIsFineTM/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThisIsFineTM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThisIsFineTM/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThisIsFineTM/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThisIsFineTM/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThisIsFineTM/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThisIsFineTM/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":5160462343,"node_id":"LA_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABM5ZoBw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal/labels/infra-ci","name":"infra-ci","color":"f9d0c4","default":false,"description":"infrastructure and/or CI changes"},{"id":6187013787,"node_id":"LA_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABcMZWmw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal/labels/P2","name":"P2","color":"2B9FE7","default":false,"description":""},{"id":7350314248,"node_id":"LA_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABthzlCA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal/labels/cppbuild","name":"cppbuild","color":"25DC6C","default":false,"description":""},{"id":7931645110,"node_id":"LA_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAAB2MNMtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":31,"created_at":"2025-05-05T16:25:11Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T03:25:42Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Just documenting it here for awareness. I spun up a Rocky Linux 9 container last night, and was able to get the out-of-the-box configuration building with the llvm-toolset (clang-18) package. I had to install a handful of dependencies, but they were all available in the standard repositories. Given that Rocky is intended to mirror Red Hat Enterprise Linux (RHEL), that does bode well for tt-metal being able to build on RHEL9.\n\nEdit: The new sub-dependency libisl.so.23 (which was hooked today) is not available in any of the Rocky/Fedora repos, which is stuck on v0.16. So any Rocky builds going forward are going to need to build libisl. See #21635 for more information.\n\nEdit2: A recent update added support for OpenMPI. I haven't tested this on the rocky container (yet), but on fedora, the openMPI/-devel packages put everything under `/usr/lib64/openmpi` with subdirectories `bin lib include share`. This appears to be because redhat ships both openmpi as well as the alternate implementation `mpich`. The FindOpenMPI.cmake that ships with the cmake-data package doesn't seem to find it by default (I probably need to put in a ticket with RH), so the workaround was to add `/usr/lib64/openmpi/bin` etc to their respective PATH environment variables. Just documenting this here since its the same distro provider.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/21636/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":3,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/21636/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/138","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/138/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/138/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/138/events","html_url":"https://github.com/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/138","id":4814682517,"node_id":"I_kwDOS8xWjc8AAAABHvo5lQ","number":138,"title":"Daily Issue Report — 2026-07-05","user":{"login":"3ni8ma","id":178741808,"node_id":"U_kgDOCqdiMA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178741808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma","html_url":"https://github.com/3ni8ma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8