r":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-07-01T09:02:55Z","updated_at":"2026-07-01T09:02:55Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"# Daily Issue Discovery — 2026-07-01\n\nFound **15** open issues matching your stack.\n\n| # | Repo | Issue | Labels |\n|---|------|-------|--------|\n| 1 | JhaSourav07/commitpulse | [test(reviewform-mock-integrations): verify Asynchronous Service Layer Mocking & Local Cache Stubs (Variation 9)](https://github.com/JhaSourav07/commitpulse/issues/7114) | good first issue, GSSoC 2026, ui, tests |\n| 2 | singh-odyssey/travellers | [in navbar stories and faq are not redirecting to their respective page .](https://github.com/singh-odyssey/travellers/issues/131) | bug, good first issue, ECSoC26, good-issue |\n| 3 | JhaSourav07/commitpulse | [test(reviewform-type-compiler): verify TypeScript Compiler Validation & Schema Constraints Stability (Variation 10)](https://github.com/JhaSourav07/commitpulse/issues/7115) | good first issue, GSSoC 2026, ui, tests |\n| 4 | lingdojo/kana-dojo | [[Good First Issue] 🎎 Add new Japan Fact 175 - Beginner-Friendly Open-source Contribution](https://github.com/lingdojo/kana-dojo/issues/22642) | enhancement, help wanted, good first issue, hacktoberfest, community, low hanging fruit, up-for-grabs, first-timers-only |\n| 5 | lingdojo/kana-dojo | [[Good First Issue] 🦑 Add new Japanese Haiku 10 - Beginner-Friendly Open-source Contribution](https://github.com/lingdojo/kana-dojo/issues/22578) | enhancement, help wanted, good first issue, hacktoberfest, community, low hanging fruit, stale-warning, up-for-grabs, first-timers-only |\n| 6 | satyapalsharma/real-time-markdown-previewer | [Implement core real-time Markdown to HTML conversion](https://github.com/satyapalsharma/real-time-markdown-previewer/issues/1) | good first issue, feature, core functionality |\n| 7 | SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty | [Pixel Art Creation with high Creative Thinking](https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/80) | good first issue, help wanted, bug bounty, AI agent friendly, bounty, 💎 Bounty, $780 |\n| 8 | SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty | [Admin routes lack role-based access control — any authenticated user can access admin endpoints](https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/1770) | bug, good first issue, help wanted, bug bounty, AI agent friendly, bounty, 💎 Bounty, $430 |\n| 9 | aryandas2911/DailyForge | [[Bug] Dashboard cards \"Upcoming Tasks\" and \"Saved Routines\" have unequal heights](https://github.com/aryandas2911/DailyForge/issues/1401) | bug, good first issue, GSSoC '26, frontend |\n| 10 | SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty | [User creation endpoint has no input validation](https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/1773) | bug, good first issue, help wanted, bug bounty, AI agent friendly, bounty, 💎 Bounty, $430 |\n| 11 | krkn-chaos/krkn | [test_v2: migrate CI/tests/test_pod_error.sh to CI/tests_v2/scenarios/pod_error_scenarios with graceful-failure coverage](https://github.com/krkn-chaos/krkn/issues/1438) | good first issue |\n| 12 | LDFLK/MarketLens | [Write crawler to extract data from rooster job posting site](https://github.com/LDFLK/MarketLens/issues/83) | good first issue |\n| 13 | statsmodels/statsmodels | [ENH: Improvements to new ARIMA-type estimators](https://github.com/statsmodels/statsmodels/issues/6159) | comp-tsa, type-enh, good first issue |\n| 14 | Code-Society-Lab/matrixpy | [Scheduler: Add `unschedule` method](https://github.com/Code-Society-Lab/matrixpy/issues/71) | good first issue |\n| 15 | FabianPlum/SMILify | [--export_animation silently treats any string as an output path](https://github.com/FabianPlum/SMILify/issues/35) | bug, good first issue |\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/79/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/79/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/7794","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/7794/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/7794/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/7794/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/7794","id":4779534882,"node_id":"I_kwDOOdNtbc8AAAABHOHqIg","number":7794,"title":"[Bug] Beacon Atlas docs and bounty instructions still point to /beacon/api/relay/discover, but the live endpoint returns 404","user":{"login":"codexbountylab","id":290542761,"node_id":"U_kgDOEVFUqQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/290542761?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codexbountylab","html_url":"https://github.com/codexbountylab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codexbountylab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codexbountylab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codexbountylab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codexbountylab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codexbountylab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codexbountylab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codexbountylab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codexbountylab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codexbountylab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-06-30T18:43:37Z","updated_at":"2026-07-01T05:52:46Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Summary\nSeveral newcomer-facing Beacon Atlas instructions still tell users to verify registrations with `https://rustchain.org/beacon/api/relay/discover`, but that path currently returns `404 Not Found` on the live site. This makes the verification step in the onboarding flow fail even when the atlas itself is live.\n\n## Where the broken endpoint is referenced\n- `Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties#422` Step 5 says to run:\n  `curl -s https://rustchain.org/beacon/api/relay/discover | python3 -m json.tool | grep YOUR_AGENT`\n- `Scottcjn/Rustchain#175` lists:\n  `curl https://rustchain.org/beacon/relay/discover`\n  as an API endpoint for viewing relay agents\n\n## Reproduction\nRun the documented verification command against the live site:\n\n```bash\ncurl -sk https://rustchain.org/beacon/api/relay/discover\n```\n\nActual result:\n\n```html\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=en>\n<title>404 Not Found</title>\n<h1>Not Found</h1>\n<p>The requested URL was not found on the server. If you entered the URL manually please check your spelling and try again.</p>\n```\n\nI also checked the public atlas page at `https://rustchain.org/beacon/`. Its boot script currently loads data through the `/beacon` app shell and `atlas-data-v4.js`, not through the documented `.../api/relay/discover` path. So the newcomer verification instructions are out of sync with the live deployment.\n\n## Environment\n- Observed from a Linux shell with `curl`\n- Checked on 2026-06-30 (UTC)\n- Public production host: `https://rustchain.org`\n- No authentication, cookies, or special headers required to reproduce\n\n## Expected behavior\nThe docs / bounty instructions should point to a working public discovery endpoint, or to the supported verification path the live atlas actually uses.\n\n## Impact\nThis is a real onboarding breakage for new contributors trying to complete Beacon Atlas registration bounties: they can follow the instructions exactly and still fail the verification step because the published endpoint is gone.\n\n## Suggested fix\n- Update the docs/issues to the current public discovery endpoint if one exists\n- Or change the verification instructions to use the authoritative profile route (`/beacon/agent/<id>`) or another supported public check\n- Consider adding a redirect from the old discovery path if backwards compatibility matters\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/7794/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/7794/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/78","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/78/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/78/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/78/events","html_url":"https://github.com/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/78","id":4782613603,"node_id":"I_kwDOS8xWjc8AAAABHRDkYw","number":78,"title":"Daily Issue Report — 2026-07-01","user":{"login":"3ni8ma","id":178741808,"node_id":"U_kgDOCqdiMA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178741808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma","html_url":"https://github.com/3ni8ma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":11336140035,"node_id":"LA_kwDOS8xWjc8AAAACo6_FAw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/labels/automated-report","name":"automated-report","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-07-01T05:06:40Z","updated_at":"2026-07-01T05:06:40Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"# Daily Issue Discovery — 2026-07-01\n\nFound **15** open issues matching your stack.\n\n| # | Repo | Issue | Labels |\n|---|------|-------|--------|\n| 1 | VeriWorkly/veriworkly | [[BUG]: Change home link in RestrictedAccess to portfolio homepage](https://github.com/VeriWorkly/veriworkly/issues/174) | bug, good first issue |\n| 2 | olboyarshinova/a11y-shiftleft-cli | [[Good first issue]: Improve Audit Coverage empty-state wording](https://github.com/olboyarshinova/a11y-shiftleft-cli/issues/25) | enhancement, help wanted, good first issue |\n| 3 | zam-os/zam | [Localize hardcoded English strings in Studio proposal editors (target 0.6.1)](https://