s/68) | good first issue |\n| 14 | Code-Society-Lab/matrixpy | [Room: Add set_name and set_topic methods](https://github.com/Code-Society-Lab/matrixpy/issues/69) | good first issue |\n| 15 | Code-Society-Lab/matrixpy | [Room: Add `get_members` method](https://github.com/Code-Society-Lab/matrixpy/issues/70) | good first issue |\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/78/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/78/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/os-santiago/homedir/issues/1043","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/os-santiago/homedir","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/os-santiago/homedir/issues/1043/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/os-santiago/homedir/issues/1043/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/os-santiago/homedir/issues/1043/events","html_url":"https://github.com/os-santiago/homedir/issues/1043","id":4782298275,"node_id":"I_kwDOQGvW7s8AAAABHQwUow","number":1043,"title":"GitHub Achievement Hub: sección interactiva para desbloquear logros y highlights de GH","user":{"login":"Axel-DaMage","id":178504369,"node_id":"U_kgDOCqPCsQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178504369?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Axel-DaMage","html_url":"https://github.com/Axel-DaMage","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Axel-DaMage/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Axel-DaMage/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Axel-DaMage/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Axel-DaMage/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Axel-DaMage/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Axel-DaMage/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Axel-DaMage/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Axel-DaMage/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Axel-DaMage/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":9502903839,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQGvW7s8AAAACNmrOHw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/os-santiago/homedir/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"a2eeef","default":true,"description":"New feature or request"},{"id":9586091695,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQGvW7s8AAAACO2Amrw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/os-santiago/homedir/labels/priority:P3","name":"priority:P3","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"description":"priority:P3"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-07-01T04:00:05Z","updated_at":"2026-07-01T04:01:04Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Resumen\nCrear una sección interactiva dentro de HomeDir que guíe a los miembros de la comunidad a desbloquear **GitHub Achievements** (logros) y **Highlights** en sus perfiles, utilizando los repositorios open-source de la organización **os-santiago** y los GitHub accounts de los propios usuarios.\n\nActualmente, HomeDir ya integra:\n- Login con GitHub\n- Sistema de gamificación (EconomyService, `CommunityContentApiResource`)\n- Perfiles de usuario con identidad GitHub\n- Conexión con el ecosistema open-source de la comunidad\n\nEste feature potenciaría el **DevRel/Onboarding** y la **gamificación open-source**, alineándose al propósito central de la plataforma.\n\n---\n\n## ¿Por qué?\n\nLos GitHub Achievements son badges que validan contribuciones, colaboración y actividad open-source. Muchos developers quieren estos logros pero no saben cómo empezar o qué pasos seguir. HomeDir es el lugar ideal para:\n\n1. **Onboarding de nuevos contributors** — Guiar a miembros paso a paso para que ganen sus primeros logros interactuando con la org.\n2. **Gamificación real** — No es un sistema ficticio: los logros se ganan en GitHub real, y HomeDir los trackea y celebra.\n3. **Retención y comunidad** — Los miembros vuelven para ver su progreso, compartir logros y ayudar a otros.\n\n---\n\n## Alcance Propuesto\n\n### 1. Sección \"GitHub Achievement Hub\"\n- Nueva página/ruta tipo `/achievements` o `/hub/achievements`\n- Diseño tipo dashboard gamificado con:\n  - **Progreso general** (logros completados vs totales)\n  - **Logros disponibles** con estado (locked / in-progress / completed)\n  - **Highlights** disponibles\n  - **Leaderboard** de la org (quién tiene más logros)\n\n### 2. Guías Interactivas por Achievement\nPara cada logro, una guía paso a paso que integre la org y el usuario:\n\n| Achievement | Cómo homeDir + org ayuda |\n|---|---|\n| **Quickdraw** | Crear un issue de prueba → cerrarlo en <5 min usando un bot/acción guiada en la org |\n| **Pull Shark** | Hacer fork de un repo de la org → editar → crear PR → mergear (guiado) |\n| **YOLO** | Mergear un PR sin review en un repo sandbox de la org |\n| **Starstruck** | Trackear estrellas de los repos de la comunidad; celebrar cuando un repo llega a 16★ |\n| **Pair Extraordinaire** | Guía para commits co-authored; emparejamiento con otro member via HomeDir |\n| **Galaxy Brain** | Responder discusiones en repos de la org que tengan Discussions habilitado |\n| **Public Sponsor** | Información sobre sponsors destacados de la org |\n| **Heart On Your Sleeve** | (según especificación futura de GitHub) |\n| **Open Sourcerer** | (según especificación futura de GitHub) |\n\n### 3. Integración con GitHub API\n- Verificar achievements reales del usuario via GH API (sección de `achievements` en el perfil)\n- Actualizar estado automáticamente (o con botón \"Verify\")\n- Mostrar logros históricos de la org (Arctic Code Vault, Mars 2020 si aplica)\n\n### 4. Gamificación en HomeDir\n- Award monedas/XP cuando un member completa un achievement guiado\n- Badge desbloqueable especial de HomeDir para quienes tengan X achievements\n- Celebrar en el feed de la comunidad cuando alguien logra uno nuevo\n\n### 5. Highlights\n- Explicar highlights como **Pro**, **Developer Program Member**, **Security Bug Bounty Hunter**, etc.\n- Links a recursos oficiales para obtenerlos (cuando aplique)\n\n---\n\n## Recursos de Referencia\n\n- **[GitHub Achievements List (drknzz)](https://github.com/drknzz/GitHub-Achievements)** — Lista completa con tiers y requisitos\n- **[GitHub Achievements Academy (Puliczek)](https://github.com/Puliczek/github-achievements-academy)** — Guías interactivas paso a paso\n- **[githubachievements.com](https://githubachievements.com/)** — Web de referencia\n- **Documentación oficial de GitHub** sobre [displaying achievements](https://docs.github.com/en/account-and-profile/setting-up-and-managing-your-github-profile/managing-contribution-settings-on-your-profile/showing-your-private-contributions-and-achievements-on-your-profile)\n\n---\n\n## Repos de la Org os-santiago Relacionados\n\nLos siguientes repos de nuestra organización son candidatos naturales para las guías interactivas:\n\n| Repo | Uso potencial |\n|---|---|\n| `os-santiago/homedir` | PRs/issues/co-authoring (Pull Shark, YOLO, Quickdraw, Pair Extraordinaire) |\n| `os-santiago/demo-repository` | Sandbox para pruebas de achievements |\n| `os-santiago/os-santiago.github.io` | PRs de documentación/diseño |\n| `os-santiago/devopsdays-santiago-webpage` | PRs issues reales del evento |\n| `os-santiago/open-quest` | Sistema gamificado existente, posible integración directa |\n| `os-santiago/github-mission-board` | Misiones/bounties, posible integración |\n\n---\n\n## Consideraciones Técnicas\n\n- **Frontend**: Qute templates + JS (estilo existente en HomeDir) o híbrido con HTMX/Alpine\n- **Backend**: Nuevo servicio `AchievementService` + endpoint REST `/api/achievements`\n- **GH API**: Usar `octokit` o REST directa para consultar achievements del perfil del usuario autenticado\n- **Cache**: Los achievements no cambian frecuentemente; cachear resultados (TTL ~1h)\n- **Seguridad**: Solo lectura del perfil público del usuario autenticado; no se requieren tokens especiales\n\n---\n\n## Criterios de Aceptación\n\n- [ ] Página `/achievements` renderiza el dashboard con todos los logros y su estado\n- [ ] Cada achievement tiene una guía interactiva o link a ella\n- [ ] El sistema puede verificar achievements reales contra la API de GitHub\n- [ ] Al completar un achievement guiado, se otorga XP/monedas en el sistema de gamificación\n- [ ] Leaderboard visible con los top members por achievements\n- [ ] La sección es mobile-responsive y sigue el design system de HomeDir\n- [ ] Documentación básica en `docs/` de cómo agregar nuevos achievements en el futuro\n\n---\n\n## Notas\n\n- Prioridad P3 por ser un feature nuevo no crítico, de alto valor comunitario\n- Ideal para **hackathons**, **Good First Issue** o **contribuciones externas**\n- Potencial integración con `open-quest` (gamificación existente en la org)\n- Podría iterarse en fases: Fase 1 = dashboard solo lectura, Fase 2 = guías interactivas, Fase 3 = gamificación completa\n\n---\n\n🏆 *\"Donde el código encuentra su hogar... y donde tus logros GitHub encuentran su vitrina\"*\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/os-santiago/homedir/issues/1043/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/os-santiago/homedir/issues/1043/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/77","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/77/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/77/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/77/events","html_url":"https://github.com/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/77","id":4781262663,"node_id":"I_kwDOS8xWjc8AAAABHPxHRw","number":77,"title":"Daily Issue Report — 2026-07-01","user":{"login":"3ni8ma","id":178741808,"node_id":"U_kgDOCqdiMA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178741808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma","html_url":"https://github.com/3ni8ma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":11336140035,"node_id":"LA_kwDOS8xWjc8AAAACo6_FAw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/labels/automated-report","name":"automated-report","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-07-01T00:08:35Z","updated_at":"2026-07-01T00:08:35Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"# Daily Issue Discovery — 2026-07-01\n\nFound **15** open issues matching your stack.\n\n| # | Repo | Issue | Labels |\n|---|------|-------|--------|\n| 1 | TencentCloud/TencentDB-Agent-Memory | [[good first issue]🎯 fix(data): checkpoint counters never decrease — drift from actual data after cleanup](https://github.com/TencentCloud/TencentDB-Agent-Memory/issues/157) | good first issue, 犀牛鸟-低难度, 腾讯犀牛鸟开源专属 |\n| 2 | cuentaprueba244w-dotcom/zeroeye | [[$20 BOUNTY] [Config] Add .editorconfig with consistent formatting rules](https://github.com/cuentaprueba244w-dotcom/zeroeye/issues/2) | documentation, help wanted, good first issue, bounty, language: |\n| 3 | lingdojo/kana-dojo | [[Good First Issue] 🗾 Add new Etiquette Tip 98 - Beginner-Friendly Open-source Contribution](https://github.com/lingdojo/kana-dojo/issues/22600) | enhancement, help wanted, good first issue, hacktoberfest, community, low hanging fruit, up-for-grabs, first-timers-only |\n| 4 | weilixiong/zeroeye | [[$30 BOUNTY] [Python] Fix HighMemoryUsage alert ratio expression](https://github.com/weilixiong/zeroeye/issues/1) | help wanted, good first issue, bounty, language:python |\n| 5 | hyperlane-xyz/hyperlane-monorepo | [[AGENTS] Set `from` address when performing `eth_estimateGas` calls](https://github.com/hyperlane-xyz/hyperlane-monorepo/issues/4585) | bug, good first issue, agent, bounty, extra-small |\n| 6 | Fmarzochi/EGC | [docs: add VS Code + GitHub Copilot setup guide to README](https://github.com/Fmarzochi/EGC/issues/549) | documentation, help wanted, good first issue |\n| 7 | francissimo/docs | [Link.francisimo](https://github.com/francissimo/docs/pull/144) | bug, documentation, duplicate, enhancement, help wanted, good first issue, wontfix |\n| 8 | Shadi-CW3/docs | [Central Web3 CW3](https://github.com/Shadi-CW3/docs/pull/1) | bug, documentation, duplicate, enhancement, help wanted, good first issue, invalid, question, wontfix, dependencies |\n| 9 | v