wing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NTMan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NTMan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NTMan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NTMan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NTMan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NTMan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NTMan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":1032039901,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDMyMDM5OTAx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ValveSoftware/Proton/labels/Game%20compatibility%20-%20Unofficial","name":"Game compatibility - Unofficial","color":"ea6e3c","default":false,"description":"Games not expected to work without issues"},{"id":1041498223,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDQxNDk4MjIz","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ValveSoftware/Proton/labels/Regression","name":"Regression","color":"b60205","default":false,"description":"Confirmed working on an older version of Proton"},{"id":1079596127,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDc5NTk2MTI3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ValveSoftware/Proton/labels/NVIDIA%20drivers","name":"NVIDIA drivers","color":"76b900","default":false,"description":"Possibly involves an issue with the NVIDIA proprietary driver"},{"id":1113044448,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTEzMDQ0NDQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ValveSoftware/Proton/labels/Mesa%20drivers","name":"Mesa drivers","color":"dc143c","default":false,"description":"Possibly involves an issue with a Mesa video driver"},{"id":2012203775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDEyMjAzNzc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ValveSoftware/Proton/labels/AMD%20RADV","name":"AMD RADV","color":"dc143c","default":false,"description":"Possible driver issues with RADV"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1721,"created_at":"2019-12-05T18:40:49Z","updated_at":"2026-06-30T18:33:55Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"# Compatibility Report\r\n- Name of the game with compatibility issues: Red Dead Redemption 2\r\n- Steam AppID of the game: 1174180\r\n\r\n## System Information\r\n- GPU: AMD Radeon VII\r\n- Driver/LLVM version: Mesa 20.0/10.0.0\r\n- Kernel version: 5.4\r\n- Link to full system information report as [Gist](https://gist.github.com/NTMan/33cca4906328793206218192820779ec)\r\n- Proton version: 4.11-9\r\n\r\n## I confirm:\r\n- [x] that I haven't found an existing compatibility report for this game.\r\n- [x] that I have checked whether there are updates for my system available.\r\n\r\n<!-- Please add `PROTON_LOG=1 %command%` to the game's launch options and drag\r\nand drop the generated `$HOME/steam-$APPID.log` into this issue report -->\r\n[steam-1174180.log](https://github.com/ValveSoftware/Proton/files/3928500/steam-1174180.log)\r\n\r\n## Symptoms <!-- What's the problem? -->\r\nRockstar Game Launcher said that unable to launch the game and recommend verify game data, but the game data successfully validated by steam.\r\n\r\n![Screenshot from 2019-12-05 22-59-27](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/200750/70263493-4d81e080-17b8-11ea-8364-59213df0d3e2.png)\r\n\r\n![Screenshot from 2019-12-05 22-59-32](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/200750/70263500-5377c180-17b8-11ea-8e08-eec65800860d.png)\r\n\r\n![Screenshot from 2019-12-06 00-09-00](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/200750/70265695-c1be8300-17bc-11ea-9ac5-d1513caed891.png)\r\n\r\n\r\n## Reproduction\r\nJust launch the game.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\n1. You can find the Steam AppID in the URL of the shop page of the game.\r\n   e.g. for `The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt` the AppID is `292030`.\r\n2. You can find your driver and Linux version, as well as your graphics\r\n   processor's name in the system information report of Steam.\r\n3. You can retrieve a full system information report by clicking\r\n   `Help` > `System Information` in the Steam client on your machine.\r\n4. Please copy it to your clipboard by pressing `Ctrl+A` and then `Ctrl+C`.\r\n   Then paste it in a [Gist](https://gist.github.com/) and post the link in\r\n   this issue.\r\n5. Please search for open issues and pull requests by the name of the game and\r\n   find out whether they are relevant and should be referenced above.\r\n-->\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ValveSoftware/Proton/issues/3291/reactions","total_count":49,"+1":45,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":3,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ValveSoftware/Proton/issues/3291/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/72","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/72/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/72/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/72/events","html_url":"https://github.com/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/72","id":4779016760,"node_id":"I_kwDOS8xWjc8AAAABHNoCOA","number":72,"title":"Daily Issue Report — 2026-06-30","user":{"login":"3ni8ma","id":178741808,"node_id":"U_kgDOCqdiMA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178741808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma","html_url":"https://github.com/3ni8ma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/gis