es/51) | good first issue, frontend, Stellar Wave |\n| 5 | karagozemin/OverSync | [[SCF high] Add resolver readiness JSON output for operator dashboards](https://github.com/karagozemin/OverSync/issues/181) | enhancement, good first issue, Stellar Wave, SCF 7.0, priority: high, investor readiness, low risk |\n| 6 | Ayushh-Sharmaa/NexaSphere | [[Bug]  Epic: Full System Internationalization (i18n) and Localization Support](https://github.com/Ayushh-Sharmaa/NexaSphere/issues/1397) | bug, good first issue, GSSoC'26, level:beginner, mentor:Ayushh-Sharmaa, priority:medium, needs-more-info, needs-labels, admin-dashboard |\n| 7 | Ayushh-Sharmaa/NexaSphere | [[CRITICAL] Unauthenticated notification and preferences endpoints — full read/write access for any user](https://github.com/Ayushh-Sharmaa/NexaSphere/issues/1474) | good first issue, GSSoC'26, level:beginner, mentor:Ayushh-Sharmaa, priority:high, needs-more-info, needs-labels, website |\n| 8 | Ayushh-Sharmaa/NexaSphere | [[HIGH] Dead helmet CSP configuration — missing formAction, frameAncestors, baseUri directives](https://github.com/Ayushh-Sharmaa/NexaSphere/issues/1475) | good first issue, GSSoC'26, level:beginner, mentor:Ayushh-Sharmaa, priority:high, needs-more-info, needs-labels, website |\n| 9 | Ayushh-Sharmaa/NexaSphere | [Issue #66: Multi-Language Support (i18n)](https://github.com/Ayushh-Sharmaa/NexaSphere/issues/1549) | good first issue, GSSoC'26, level:beginner, mentor:Ayushh-Sharmaa, priority:medium, needs-more-info, needs-labels, website, P2, feature, component: localization |\n| 10 | Ayushh-Sharmaa/NexaSphere | [Issue #68: Font Size Adjustment](https://github.com/Ayushh-Sharmaa/NexaSphere/issues/1551) | enhancement, good first issue, GSSoC'26, level:beginner, mentor:Ayushh-Sharmaa, priority:medium, needs-more-info, needs-labels, website, P3, component: accessibility |\n| 11 | pyfenn/fenn | [fix: add type annotations to fenn.logging](https://github.com/pyfenn/fenn/pull/194) | help wanted, good first issue, code quality |\n| 12 | vllm-project/vllm-omni | [[New Model]: dots.tts (rednote-hilab) — continuous-AR 48kHz zero-shot voice cloning](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-omni/issues/4218) | help wanted, good first issue, new model, tts |\n| 13 | Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties | [[ONBOARD: 2 RTC] Star + Compare RustChain to Another Blockchain Project](https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2786) | good first issue, bounty, community, onboarding |\n| 14 | pyfenn/fenn | [Add type hints to cli.__init__.py](https://github.com/pyfenn/fenn/pull/193) | help wanted, good first issue, code quality |\n| 15 | Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties | [[ONBOARD: 1 RTC] Star + Review an Open PR](https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782) | good first issue, bounty, onboarding |\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/68/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/68/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode/issues/256854","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode/issues/256854/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode/issues/256854/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode/issues/256854/events","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode/issues/256854","id":3245335213,"node_id":"I_kwDOAn8RLM7Bb-Kt","number":256854,"title":"Review AsyncIterableObject usage: potential memory leaks and migration to AsyncIterableProducer","user":{"login":"hediet","id":2931520,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MzE1MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2931520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hediet","html_url":"