vement found under the open bounty program in #33.\n\n## Problem\n\n`.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/task.md` uses `labels: good-first-issue`, but the repository label is configured as `good first issue` in `.github/labels.yml`. New issues created from the template may miss the intended label.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- Update the small task issue template to use the existing `good first issue` label name.\n- Keep the change focused to the issue template.\n- Link this issue from the PR.\n\n/bounty $50","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/2434/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/2434/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/61","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/61/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/61/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/61/events","html_url":"https://github.com/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/61","id":4767128124,"node_id":"I_kwDOS8xWjc8AAAABHCSaPA","number":61,"title":"Daily Issue Report — 2026-06-29","user":{"login":"3ni8ma","id":178741808,"node_id":"U_kgDOCqdiMA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178741808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma","html_url":"https://github.com/3ni8ma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3ni8ma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","su