url":"https://github.com/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/875","id":4601721645,"node_id":"I_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAABEkizLQ","number":875,"title":"Seed Good First Issues workflow recreates duplicate starter issues","user":{"login":"bozicovichsantiago20-oss","id":290439273,"node_id":"U_kgDOEU_AaQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/290439273?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bozicovichsantiago20-oss","html_url":"https://github.com/bozicovichsantiago20-oss","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bozicovichsantiago20-oss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bozicovichsantiago20-oss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bozicovichsantiago20-oss/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bozicovichsantiago20-oss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bozicovichsantiago20-oss/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bozicovichsantiago20-oss/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bozicovichsantiago20-oss/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bozicovichsantiago20-oss/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bozicovichsantiago20-oss/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":9,"created_at":"2026-06-06T03:33:41Z","updated_at":"2026-06-28T12:05:40Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"/bounty $50\n\nReferences #33.\n\n## Problem\n\nThe manual `Seed Good First Issues` workflow always calls `github.rest.issues.create` for every starter issue. If a maintainer reruns the workflow, it recreates the same seeded bounty issues instead of treating the seed as an idempotent operation.\n\nThat creates duplicate issues for the same starter tasks, splits contributor attempts across copies, and can confuse bounty tracking.\n\n## Expected behavior\n\nThe seed workflow should inspect existing repository issues before creating starter issues. If an issue with the same starter title already exists, it should skip creation and continue with the remaining missing starter issues.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- Update `.github/workflows/seed-issues.yml` so it checks existing non-PR issue titles before creating starter issues.\n- Existing starter issues are skipped on rerun.\n- Missing starter issues can still be created.\n- Keep the change focused on the workflow seeding logic.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/875/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/875/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/769","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xevrion-v2/agent-playground","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/769/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/769/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/769/events","html_url":"https://github.com/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/769","id":4596417081,"node_id":"I_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAABEffCOQ","number":769,"title":"Small task issue template uses non-existent good-first-issue label","user":{"login":"IvanchitorJR","id":181440709,"node_id":"U_kgDOCtCQxQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181440709?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IvanchitorJR","html_url":"https://github.com/IvanchitorJR","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IvanchitorJR/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IvanchitorJR/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IvanchitorJR/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IvanchitorJR/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IvanchitorJR/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IvanchitorJR/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IvanchitorJR/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IvanchitorJR/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IvanchitorJR/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-06-05T11:06:16Z","updated_at":"2026-06-28T11:52:40Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"/bounty $50\n\nReferences #33.\n\n## Problem\n\nThe small task issue template uses a hyphenated label name:\n\n```yaml\nlabels: good-first-issue\n```\n\nBut the repository's label configuration defines the intended label as `good first issue` with spaces, and the seeded issue workflow also applies `good first issue`.\n\nThat mismatch means issues created from `.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/task.md` can miss the expected first-contributor discovery label or try to apply a non-standard duplicate label name.\n\n## Expected behavior\n\nThe small task template should use the same canonical label name as `.github/labels.yml` and the seed workflows.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- Update `.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/task.md` to use `good first issue` instead of `good-first-issue`.\n- Keep the change focused on the issue template and required AI agent metadata.\n- Verify there are no remaining `good-first-issue` references in issue templates.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/769/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/769/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/undici/issues/4403","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/undici","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/undici/issues/4403/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/undici/issues/4403/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/undici/issues/4403/events","html_url":"https://github.com/nodejs/undici/issues/4403","id":3307409495,"node_id":"I_kwDOB-7WbM7FIxBX","number":4403,"title":"AI created PRs","user":{"login":"Uzlopak","id":5059100,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNTkxMDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5059100?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Uzlopak","html_url":"https://github.com/Uzlopak","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Uzlopak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Uzlopak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Uzlopak/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Uzlopak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Uzlopak/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Uzlopak/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Uzlopak/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Uzlopak/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Uzlopak/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":12,"created_at":"2025-08-10T09:54:44Z","updated_at":"2026-06-28T10:45:36Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"In the last days we got PRs which seem to bs AI created. Obviously \"good first issue\" s are targetted. \n\nThe point of a good first issue is not, that we encourage people to use AI to fix simple tasks but to encourage devs to participate and contribute to a project.\n\nI have no issue with using AI, but then there should be already a quality control by the \"implementer\" and not by us alone.\n\nSome tasks are faster implemented in good quality than reviewing that AI slop. We are not here to give input so that the person takes our remarks to let claude or whatever fix the remark. \n\nIt is so annoying...","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/undici/issues/4403/reactions","total_count":10,"+1":10,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/undici/issues/4403/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/19","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/19/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/19/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/19/events","html_url":"https://github.com/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/19","id":4746053063,"node_id":"I_kwDOS8xWjc8AAAABGuMFxw","number":19,"title":"Daily Issue Report — 2026-06-25","user":{"login":"3ni8ma","id":17874180